 "text": "Hey, what's going on? A gift of time or attention is always appreciated. Could you plan something with your friend, like a walk in park, or cooking dinner together? Chocolate is a great option. A handwritten note with the chocolate in the middle is a lovely touch. One nice bar per person, maybe two if there are kids involved. Don't overdo it, the note is what really matters. Put the name of the person on the wrapper so they know who it' from. Some people save their favorite bars for special people, so it' thoughtful to pick one they love.",
